  "strings": [
    "His power shattered\u0000",
    "Saruman could not prevail against the courage that was arrayed against him...\u0000",
    "and in the end his betrayal was avenged.\u0000",
    "Treebeard now serves as master of Orthanc.\u0000",
    "And the pits of Isengard have been cleansed of Saruman's filth.\u0000",
    "But the Dark Lord's power has not been broken...\u0000",
    "for Saruman served merely as a pawn...\u0000",
    "a distraction to weaken Gondor's borders.\u0000",
    "Within Mordor the armies of Sauron grow...\u0000",
    "and his war has hardly begun.\u0000"
  ]
